sts were still failing. I read its diff, merged its branch `local-agent/j-20261016-d56bcb` with `git merge --ff-only`, and wrote the rest myself.\n\n**From the local model:**\n- **`Loader.load`:** the override loop in `api.py` now substitutes the value before converting it. `SetEnv` types and loads with no `conf` keep the raw value.\n- **`Loader.substitute`:** the base method in `api.py` raises `NotImplementedError`.\n- **`IniLoader.substitute`:** added in `ini/__init__.py`.\n\n**Added by me:**\n- **`TomlLoader.substitute`:** added in `toml/__init__.py`, which fixed the four failing tests.\n- **Changelog:** created `docs/changelog/4047.bugfix.rst`.\n- **Docs:** added the \"Substitutions inside an override\" subsection to `docs/reference/config.rst`, placed just before \"Overrides propagate through references\".\n\n**Deviation from the spec:** the model typed `conf` as `Config | None` in the new `substitute` methods, where the spec says `Config`. I kept that for consistency with `build`. I didn't run any checks beyond the loader test file.\n\nMy changes are uncommitted in the working tree.", "ttft_ms": 2121, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 1054098, "uuid": "42457e70-1793-417d-bd19-d98706828fb6", "ttft_stream_ms": 1729, "time_to_request_ms": 50, "first_content_frame_ms": 1729, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
